  "description": "Umbra.Core.Router is a lightweight and framework-agnostic routing library for .NET applications.\n            It provides a fast trie-based router with support for route parameters, catch-all segments,\n            navigation guards, and dependency injection.\n\n            Designed as a core routing engine that can be integrated with any UI framework\n            (Avalonia, WPF, WinUI, MAUI, Blazor, or custom architectures) to build flexible\n            view or view-model navigation systems.",
